    {
      "dom_id": "question-177454",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "$7$ is a composite number **and** odd, **or** $2+6 \\geq 10.$\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:\n\n- $A: \\textrm{$7$ is a composite number}$\n\n- $B: \\textrm{$7$ is odd}$\n\n- $C: \\textrm{$2+6 \\geq 10$}$",
      "worked_solution": "The word \"and\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\land$\", while the word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"$\\lor$\".\n\nNote that this sentence consists of two parts:\n\n- **Part 1:** $7$ is a composite number and odd. This corresponds to\n\\[\n\\underbrace{7 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is a composite number}}_A \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \n\\underbrace{7 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is odd} }_B,\n\\]\nthat is, $A \\land B.$\n\n- **Part 2:** $2+6 \\geq 10.$ This corresponds to $C.$\n\nSo, we can express the sentence as\n\\[\n\\underbrace{7 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is a composite number} \\textbf{ and } \\textrm{odd} }_{A \\, \\land \\, B}, \\quad \n\\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{or}}_{\\lor} \\quad \n\\underbrace{2+6 \\geq 10 }_C \n\\]\nthat is, $(A \\land B) \\lor C.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-177454\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">6.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"177454\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>$7$ is a composite number <strong>and</strong> odd, <strong>or</strong> $2+6 \\geq 10.$</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>$A: \\textrm{$7$ is a composite number}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$B: \\textrm{$7$ is odd}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$C: \\textrm{$2+6 \\geq 10$}$</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:08 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
