      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-177454\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">6.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"177454\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>$7$ is a composite number <strong>and</strong> odd, <strong>or</strong> $2+6 \\geq 10.$</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>$A: \\textrm{$7$ is a composite number}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$B: \\textrm{$7$ is odd}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$C: \\textrm{$2+6 \\geq 10$}$</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:08 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:16</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
