      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-178520\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">7.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"178520\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>$9$ is a perfect square, <strong>or</strong> $ 3 \\geq 4$ <strong>or</strong> $ 3= 5-1.$</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>$P: \\textrm{$9$ is a perfect square}$ </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$Q: \\textrm{$3 \\geq 4$}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$R: \\textrm{$3=5-1$}$</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:08 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:14</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
