      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-177457\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">10.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"177457\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><blockquote>\n<p>$4$ is even <strong>or</strong> $4^2=12$, <strong>and</strong> $-2$ is an integer number.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Express the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following notations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>$M: \\textrm{$4$ is even}$ </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$N: \\textrm{$4^2=12$}$</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>$P: \\textrm{$-2$ is an integer number}$</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:09 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:14</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "dom_id": "question-175913",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "\\[\n\\underbrace{\\sqrt{5}\\in\\mathbb{R}}_A \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{10 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is even}}_B\n\\]\n\nFor the compound statement above, we have that",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following facts about the \"and\" $(\\land)$ and \"or\" $(\\lor)$ logical connectives:\n\n- The statement $A \\land B$ is true if *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n- The statement $A \\lor B$ is true if either $A$ is true, or $B$ is true, or *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\nIn our case, $A$ is true, and $B$ is true. Therefore, the result is true:\n\\begin{align*}\n\\underbrace{\\sqrt{5}\\in\\mathbb{R}}_A \\quad \n\\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \n\\underbrace{10 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is even}}_B\n&\\:\\:\\equiv\\: \\text{true} \\land \\textrm{true} \\equiv \\textrm{true}\n\\end{align*}",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-175913\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">11.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"175913\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{\\sqrt{5}\\in\\mathbb{R}}_A \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{10 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is even}}_B\n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-175913\" class=\"questionBody\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:10 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:27</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
