      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-175912\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">12.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"175912\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{3\\,|\\,9}_A \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{3\\,|\\,16}_B\n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-175912\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:10 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:25</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
