      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-175917\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">15.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"175917\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{\\{1, 2\\}\\cap \\{3\\}=\\{1,2,3\\}}_A \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{9 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is prime}}_B\n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-175917\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:12 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:28</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
