    {
      "dom_id": "question-178151",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "\\[\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{N}\\cap \\mathbb{Z}=\\mathbb{N} }_P \n\\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{\\overbrace{3 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is even}}^Q \n\\quad \\overbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{or}}^{\\lor} \\quad \n\\overbrace{39 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is prime} }^R }_{Q \\, \\lor \\, R}\n\\]\n\nFor the compound statement above, we have that",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following facts about the \"and\" $(\\land)$ and \"or\" $(\\lor)$ logical connectives:\n\n- The statement $A \\land B$ is true if *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n- The statement $A \\lor B$ is true if either $A$ is true, or $B$ is true, or *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\nIn our case, $P$ is true, $Q$ is false, and $R$ is false. Therefore, $Q \\lor R$ is false, and the result is false:\n\\begin{align*}\nP \\land ( Q\\lor R )\n&\\equiv\\text{true} \\land \\overbrace{(\\textrm{false} \\lor \\textrm{false})}^{\\textrm{false}}\\\\[5pt]\n&\\equiv \\textrm{true} \\land \\textrm{false} \\\\[3pt]\n&\\equiv \\textrm{false}\n\\end{align*}",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Incorrect",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-178151\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">16.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"178151\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{N}\\cap \\mathbb{Z}=\\mathbb{N} }_P \n\\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{\\overbrace{3 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is even}}^Q \n\\quad \\overbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{or}}^{\\lor} \\quad \n\\overbrace{39 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is prime} }^R }_{Q \\, \\lor \\, R}\n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-178151\" class=\"questionBody\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:12 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:26</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
