      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-178151\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">16.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"178151\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{N}\\cap \\mathbb{Z}=\\mathbb{N} }_P \n\\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{\\overbrace{3 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is even}}^Q \n\\quad \\overbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{or}}^{\\lor} \\quad \n\\overbrace{39 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is prime} }^R }_{Q \\, \\lor \\, R}\n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-178151\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:12 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:26</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
