      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-178152\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">20.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"178152\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>\\[\n\\underbrace{\\overbrace{3^2=9}^P \n\\quad \\overbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}^{\\land} \\quad \n\\overbrace{2 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is rational}}^Q }_{P \\, \\land \\, Q}\n\\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \n\\underbrace{\\sqrt5 \\vphantom{|}\\textrm{ is irrational} }_R \n\\]</p>\n<p>For the compound statement above, we have that</p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-178152\"></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 11:14 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:26</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
