    {
      "dom_id": "step-153506",
      "name": "Example: \n                    Finding Truth Values of Complex Statements",
      "problem": "Consider the following compound statement:\n\n$$\n\\underbrace{\\mathbb{Z}\\cup \\mathbb{R}=\\mathbb{Z} }_P \n\\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{and}}_{\\land} \\quad \\underbrace{\\overbrace{7 \\,|\\, 21}^Q \n\\quad \\overbrace{\\vphantom{|}\\textbf{or}}^{\\lor} \\quad \n\\overbrace{7 \\,|\\, 29}^R }_{Q \\, \\lor \\, R}\n$$\n\nFind the truth values of the statements $P,$ $Q$ and $R,$ and the compound statements $Q\\lor R$ and $P\\land (Q\\lor R).$",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following facts about the \"and\" $(\\land)$ and \"or\" $(\\lor)$ logical connectives:\n\n- The statement $A \\land B$ is true if *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\n- The statement $A \\lor B$ is true if either $A$ is true, or $B$ is true, or *both* $A$ and $B$ are true.\n\nIn our case, $P$ is false, $Q$ is true, and $R$ is false. Therefore, $Q \\lor R$ is true, but the result is false:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P∧(Q∨R) & ≡\\text{false}∧\\overset{\\text{true}}{\\overset{⏞}{(\\text{true}∨\\text{false})}} \\\\  & ≡\\text{false}∧\\text{true} \\\\  & ≡\\text{false}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": null,
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"step-153506\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"153506\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12895\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-153506\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-13\">Finding Truth Values of Complex Statements</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"153506\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n               