\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-72\" x=\"389\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-75\" x=\"782\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-65\" x=\"1338\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>In this context, the symbol \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.808ex\" height=\"1.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: 0.081ex; margin-bottom: -0.253ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -576.1 778.5 649.8\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\\equiv</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2261\" d=\"M56 444Q56 457 70 464H707Q722 456 722 444Q722 430 706 424H72Q56 429 56 444ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM56 56Q56 71 72 76H706Q722 70 722 56Q722 44 707 36H70Q56 43 56 56Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2261\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\" means \"is logically equivalent to.\" </p>\n<p>Let's now consider a similar compound statement but with the <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.162ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E12-MJMAIN-32\" d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T23