                          min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>The word \"or\" is represented by the symbol \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.009ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -719.6 667.5 865.1\" width=\"1.55ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\lor</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M55 580Q56 587 61 592T75 598Q86 598 96 580L333 48L570 580Q579 596 586 597Q588 598 591 598Q609 598 611 580Q611 574 546 426T415 132T348 -15Q343 -22 333 -22T318 -15Q317 -14 252 131T121 425T55 580Z\" id=\"E1-MJMAIN-2228\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E1-MJMAIN-2228\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\".</p>\n<p>So, the sentence reads</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"6.343ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -4.171ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -934.9 22035.1 2730.8\" width=\"51.178ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n\\underbrace{14 \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is divisible by }\\vphantom{p} 4 }_S \\quad \\underbrace{\\vphantom{p}\\textbf{or}}_{\\lor} \\quad \\underbrace{\\sqrt{3} \\vphantom{p}\\textrm{ is a rational number} }_T,\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M213 578L200 573Q186 568 160 563T102 556H83V602H102Q149 604 189 617T245 641T273 663Q275 666 285 666Q294 666 302 660V361L303 61Q310 54 315 52T339 48T401 46H427V0H416Q395 3 257 3Q121 3 100 0H88V46H114Q136 46 152 46T177 47T193 50T201 52T207 57T213 61V578Z\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-31\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0