 201T380 248V315Q380 361 370 372T320 385H302V431Q304 431 378 436T457 442H464V264Q464 84 465 81Q468 61 479 55T524 46H542V0Q540 0 467 -5T390 -11H383V58Z\" id=\"E10-MJMAIN-75\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M28 218Q28 273 48 318T98 391T163 433T229 448Q282 448 320 430T378 380T406 316T415 245Q415 238 408 231H126V216Q126 68 226 36Q246 30 270 30Q312 30 342 62Q359 79 369 104L379 128Q382 131 395 131H398Q415 131 415 121Q415 117 412 108Q393 53 349 21T250 -11Q155 -11 92 58T28 218ZM333 275Q322 403 238 411H236Q228 411 220 410T195 402T166 381T143 340T127 274V267H333V275Z\" id=\"E10-MJMAIN-65\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(167,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(-11,0)\">\n<g transform=\"translate(0,-50)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMATHI-41\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"972\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2227\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1862\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMATHI-42\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2899\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2261\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(3956,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n<use x=\"389\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-72\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"782\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-75\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1338\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-65\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"5961\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2227\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(6850,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n<use x=\"389\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-72\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"782\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-75\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1338\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-65\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"8911\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2261\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(9968,0)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-74\"></use>\n<use x=\"389\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-72\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"782\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-75\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1338\" xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-65\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n</svg></span></p>\n<p>In this context, the symbol \"<span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: 0.081ex; margin-bottom: -0.253ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -576.1 778.5 649.8\" width=\"1.808ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\\equiv</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M56 444Q56 457 70 464H707Q722 456 722 444Q722 430 706 424H72Q56 429 56 444ZM56 237T56 250T70 270H707Q722 262 722 250T707 230H70Q56 237 56 250ZM56 56Q56 71 72 76H706Q722 70 722 56Q722 44 707 36H70Q56 43 56 56Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2261\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2261\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span>\" means \"is logically equivalent to.\" </p>\n<p>Let's now consider a similar compound statement but with the <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" width=\"1.162ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">2</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M109 429Q82 429 66 447T50 491Q50 562 103 614T235 666Q326 666 387 610T449 465Q449 422 429 383T381 315T301 241Q265 210 201 149L142 93L218 92Q375 92 385 97Q392 99 409 186V189H449V186Q448 183 436 95T421 3V0H50V19V31Q50 38 56 46T86 81Q115 113 136 137Q145 147 170 174T204 211T233 244T261 278T284 308T305 340T320 369T333 401T340 431T343 464Q343 527 309 573T212 619Q179 619 154 602T119 569T109 550Q109 549 114 549Q132 549 151 535T170 489Q170 464 154 447T109 429Z\" id=\"E12-MJMAIN-32\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMAIN-32\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> replaced with a <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 500.5 936.9\" width=\"1.162ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">3</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M127 463Q100 463 85 480T69 524Q69 579 117 622T233 665Q268 665 277 664Q351 652 390 611T430 522Q430 470 396 421T302 350L299 348Q299 347 308 345T337 336T375 315Q457 262 457 175Q457 96 395 37T238 -22Q158 -22 100 21T42 130Q42 158 60 175T105 193Q133 193 151 175T169 130Q169 119 166 110T159 94T148 82T136 74T126 70T118 67L114 66Q165 21 238 21Q293 21 321 74Q338 107 338 175V195Q338 290 274 322Q259 328 213 329L171 330L168 332Q166 335 166 348Q166 366 174 366Q202 366 232 371Q266 376 294 413T322 525V533Q322 590 287 612Q265 626 240 626Q208 626 181 615T143 592T132 580H135Q138 579 143 578T153 573T165 566T175 555T183 540T186 520Q186 498 172 481T127 463Z\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-33\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E13-MJMAIN-33\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> in the second statement.</p>\n<p><span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"6.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -2.329ex; margin-bottom: -0.176ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -1580.7 12854 2659.1\" width=\"29.855ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-14-Title\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"11\"